 ing the 2027 Pokémon Latin America International Championships Twitch bro
 adcast.\n\nPsyRhino took home the gold at the 2026 Pokémon GO North Ameri
 ca International Championships with a powerful Shadow Samurott on their te
 am. Watch the 2027 LAIC stream\, and you can get a Samurott inspired by Ps
 yRhino’s NAIC-winning team.\n\nTune in toTwitch.tv/PokemonGOon November 
 20 and 21\, orTwitch.tv/Pokemonon November 22\, and you’ll earn rewards 
 the longer you watch. Here’s what you can get:\n\nWatch for 30 minutes:U
 nique Timed Research that includes the following.\n\nWatch for 45 minutes:
 An LAIC Battle Bundle that includes the following.\n\nMore info: https://l
 eekduck.com/events/pokemon-latin-america-international-championships-2027-
 timed-research-twitch-drops/\n\nData from LeekDuck.com
